---
description: Stack and conventions, always active
alwaysApply: true
---

- Stack: Next.js 16, Postgres via Supabase, Drizzle ORM, Vercel hosting.
- Search: `pg_trgm` only. Do not add Typesense/Meilisearch/Elastic without
  explicit sign-off — not justified at current scale.
- Graph UI: react-flow for the cognate view.
- Fonts via `next/font/google`: Inter as primary; load Noto Sans Hebrew /
  Arabic / Devanagari only for scripts Inter doesn't cover, stacked via
  CSS font-family fallback. Never bulk-load all Noto script families.
- Testing: Playwright for E2E. Unit-test the ETL transform step
  specifically — it's the most likely place to silently produce wrong
  data.
- All DB access through Drizzle, no raw SQL in app code outside
  migrations/seeds.
- Every enriched field traces to a `source` (and ideally `source_url`) —
  don't write enrichment content without attribution.
